sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Owner as Device Owner
    participant Web as Web Dashboard (React)
    participant Cloud as Cloud Firestore
    participant App as Android Client (SecureTrack)

    Owner->>Web: Click "Add New Device"
    Web->>Web: Generate cryptographically random code
    Web->>Cloud: Create invitation doc (code, ownerUid, 10m TTL)
    Cloud-->>Web: Document stored
    Web->>Web: Render QR Code on screen

    Owner->>App: Launch App & tap "Scan QR Code"
    App->>Web: Camera scans QR Code payload
    App->>Cloud: Query invitation by code & claim (used = true)
    Cloud-->>App: Claim verified & ownerUid associated
    App->>Cloud: Register device doc (status: "ONLINE", telemetry)
    Cloud-->>App: Registration successful
    Cloud-->>Web: Real-time listener triggers update
    Web-->>Owner: Displays new device as ONLINE
